.TH RGBSEC-KEYGEN 1 "2026-08-19" "rgbdns 0.6.3" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
rgbsec-keygen \- create an rgbdns DNSSEC signing key and policy line
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B rgbsec-keygen
.I zone keyfile
.SH DESCRIPTION
Creates a new ECDSA P-256 PKCS#8 private key with mode 0600 and prints the
corresponding one-line rgbdns DNSSEC policy. The key file must not already
exist. Run this command only on the signing primary.
.SH EXIT STATUS
Zero on success, 100 for usage errors, and 111 for operational failures.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR rgbsec-sign (1),
.BR rgbsec-ds (1),
.BR rgbdns (7)
